            "padding_top": 90
           }
          },
          "subhead": "<p>Praxera&nbsp;has been formulating dietary supplements for integrative physicians and serious brand-builders since 1976. Our private label program brings that decades-deep expertise to entrepreneurs and established brands launching their own supplement lines.</p>",
          "subhead_size": 19,
          "text_color": "dark"
         },
