         "label": "module_1",
         "name": "module_1",
         "params": {
          "align": "left",
          "body_size": 18,
          "content": "<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">Built on truth in labeling, scientific rigor, and respect for the entrepreneur.</h2>\n<p>Praxera was founded in 1976 with a simple commitment: build dietary supplements that integrative healthcare professionals could trust to actually work. That commitment shaped everything that came after: how we source ingredients, how we formulate, how we test, and how we label what is in the bottle.</p>\n<p>Five decades later, we have grown into a 190-plus product catalog manufactured in our FDA-registered, GMP-certified Vermont facility. The original commitment has not changed. What is on the label is what is in the bottle. No proprietary blends hiding underdosing. No cheap fillers we will not disclose. No marketing claims our science cannot support.</p>",
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "heading_size": 32,
          "max_width": 810,
          "module_id": 218940115784,
