         "cssStyle": "",
         "label": "module_4",
         "name": "module_4",
         "params": {
          "align": "left",
          "body_size": 18,
          "content": "<p>For most of our history, Praxera's primary customer was the integrative medicine community: naturopathic doctors, functional medicine practitioners, chiropractors, and other healthcare professionals who recommended our supplements to their patients. That clinical scrutiny shaped our formulation standards. Our products had to work, had to be safe, and had to be backed by science that practitioners could defend to their peers.</p>\n<p>We launched our private label program to extend that same manufacturing standard to a broader audience: entrepreneurs and established brand-builders who want to launch their own supplement lines without compromising on quality. The same facility, the same formulations, the same testing protocols, just under your brand.</p>",
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "heading_size": 32,
          "max_width": 810,
          "module_id": 218940115784,
