         "label": "module_6",
         "name": "module_6",
         "params": {
          "body_color": {
           "color": "#555555",
           "opacity": 100
          },
          "body_size": 15,
          "card_align": "left",
          "card_density": "standard",
          "card_style": "card",
          "cards": [
           {
            "content": "<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">What is on the label is what is in the bottle. No proprietary blends hiding underdosing. No fillers we will not disclose. Your customers (and their healthcare providers) can trust your products at the ingredient level. We hold ourselves to this standard not because regulations demand it, but because it is the right way to formulate supplements.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/Praxera/label-approval-ink.png"
            },
            "title": "Truth in labeling"
           },
           {
            "content": "<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Every formulation is doctor-formulated and scientifically reviewed before it enters production. We use clinical-grade ingredients at therapeutic doses, not marketing doses. When the research changes, our formulations evolve. This is how supplements actually deliver outcomes customers can feel.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/Praxera/doctor-formulated-ink.png"
            },
            "title": "Scientific rigor"
           },
           {
            "content": "<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Our private label clients are not accounts on a spreadsheet. They are brand-builders we work alongside for years. We share what we have learned in 50 years of providing supplements because helping you build a great brand is what makes this work meaningful for our team.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/Praxera/white-glove-support-ink.png"
            },
            "title": "Partnership, not transaction"
           }
          ],
