         "label": "module_7",
         "name": "module_7",
         "params": {
          "body_size": 16,
          "content": "<p>Our facility in Williston, Vermont houses production lines for capsules, tablets, powders, softgels, chewables, liquids, and oral sprays. On-site quality laboratory. Climate-controlled raw material warehousing. Finished goods inventory for ready-to-ship private label SKUs. FDA-registered. GMP certified to SQF food safety and NSF GMP 455-2 standards. Run by people who have been making dietary supplements together for decades.</p>",
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "eyebrow": "OUR FACILITY",
