         "label": "module_9",
         "name": "module_9",
         "params": {
          "align": "left",
          "body_size": 18,
          "content": "<p>Praxera of Vermont is part of the FoodScience family of companies, a U.S. owned manufacturer of nutritional supplements for humans and pets. FoodScience operates multiple manufacturing facilities and product brands serving the integrative medicine, retail, veterinary, and private label channels. The scale of FoodScience LLC gives our Praxera private label clients access to manufacturing infrastructure, ingredient sourcing networks, and quality systems that would be impossible at a smaller scale.</p>\n<p>Operating at the Praxera&nbsp;level keeps the relationship with each private label client direct and personal. You work with our team. The same people who answer your questions during evaluation are the people who manage your engagement after launch.</p>",
